      "name": "source-protection-area-generalized",
      "notes": "A source protection area (SPA) is an area of land and water governed by a\r\nSource Protection Authority, an agency, person or body.\r\n\r\nThis dataset defines the geographic boundaries where each SPA's terms of\r\nreference, assessment reports and source protection plans must be developed.\r\n\r\n  *[SPA]: source protection area\r\n\r\n",
      "notes_translated": {
        "fr": "Une zone de protection des sources et de zone de terre et d'eau gouvernee par\r\nun office de protection des sources, une agence, une personne ou un organisme.\r\n\r\nCet ensemble de donnees definit les limites geographiques ou chaque mandat,\r\nrapport d'evaluation et plans de protection des sources de la ZPS doivent etre\r\nelabore.\r\n\r\n  *[ZPS]: Zone de protection des sources\r\n\r\n",
        "en": "A source protection area (SPA) is an area of land and water governed by a\r\nSource Protection Authority, an agency, person or body.\r\n\r\nThis dataset defines the geographic boundaries where each SPA's terms of\r\nreference, assessment reports and source protection plans must be developed.\r\n\r\n  *[SPA]: source protection area\r\n\r\n"
      },
