    "description": "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n<div>A source protection area (SPA) is an area of land and water governed by a Source Protection Authority, an agency, person or body.</div>\n<div> <br /> </div>\n<div>This dataset defines the geographic boundaries where each SPA\u2019s terms of reference, assessment reports and source protection plans must be developed.</div>\n<div> <br /> </div>\n<div> <strong>Additional Documentation</strong><br /></div>\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Source%20Protection%20Area%20Generalized%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Source Protection Area Generalized - Data Description (PDF)</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Source Protection Area Generalized - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Source Protection Area Generalized - Documentation (Word)</a></li>\n\n</ul></div> \n<div><br /> </div>\n<div> <strong>Status</strong> <br /></div><div>Completed: production of the data has been completed<br /> </div> <div> <br /> </div><div> <strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency<br /> </strong> </div><div>As needed: data is updated as deemed necessary<br /> </div> <div> <br /> </div><div> <strong>Contact<br /></strong> </div> <div>Derek Hatfield, Program Support Section,<a href='mailto:derek.hatfield@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'> derek.hatfield@ontario.ca</a> </div></span>",
